# Reader: open the library from home, open the Chinese book, read 14 pages
# (keys, swipes, tap zones), idle long enough for the position to be saved,
# go home. Coordinates in dp / % (portable).
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # the "阅读" favourite on the one-page home (D-135)
+2500ms  snap  library
+500ms   tap   50% 228dp          # third book (64 + 2*68 dp): 测试长书 (40 parts)
+3s      snap  page1
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  snap  page4
+500ms   key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  swipe 85% 50% 15% 50% 250ms
+1500ms  swipe 85% 50% 15% 50% 250ms
+1500ms  tap   85% 50%            # right two thirds: next page
+1500ms  tap   85% 50%
+1500ms  tap   15% 50%            # left third: previous page
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  snap  page13
+12s     key   home               # position is saved during the idle gap
+3s      snap  home
+500ms   end
